  "prefLabel": "Rev 1007.04 Tobacco License Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1007.04 Tobacco License Application.\n\n(a) Manufacturers and wholesalers intending to engage in the business of selling or distributing tobacco products in this state shall:\n\n(1) Complete and file Form DP-31, “Application for Tobacco Tax License”, with the department in accordance with Rev 1008.10; and\n\n(2) Remit the applicable statutory fee pursuant to RSA 78:6, IV.\n\nSource. #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; amd by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1008.04) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
